{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Covering\/documentation\/Covering","doc:\/\/Covering\/documentation\/Covering\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Covering\/documentation\/Covering\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"lexicographicallyFirstMinimumDominatingSet"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Γ is found as in "},{"code":"minimumDominatingSet()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", with the dominated-vertex rule applied only in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"favour of a lesser vertex, which keeps the least set. The least set of γ vertices is then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"decided vertex by vertex in index order against a witness, each decision a search of only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the part of the problem the vertex touches. Memory as "},{"code":"minimumDominatingSet()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Exponential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the component size in the worst case, and up to one search per vertex, so it can be far"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"slower than "},{"code":"minimumDominatingSet()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; the search does not check for task cancellation."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/covering\/graphprotocols\/graph\/lexicographicallyfirstminimumdominatingset()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The lexicographically first minimum dominating set: of the smallest dominating sets, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"least by vertex index (the rule of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lexicographicallyFirstMaximumIndependentSet()"},{"type":"text","text":"), in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order; [] for the empty graph. Self-loops and parallel edges do not matter;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"isolated vertices are in it."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Covering\/documentation\/Covering\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/lexicographicallyFirstMinimumDominatingSet()"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"ExactCovering.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Covering\/ExactCovering.swift#L1780"},"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","title":"lexicographicallyFirstMinimumDominatingSet()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lexicographicallyFirstMinimumDominatingSet","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P8CoveringE42lexicographicallyFirstMinimumDominatingSetSay6VertexQzGyF","modules":[{"name":"Covering","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"symbolKind":"method"},"references":{"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/Graph/Vertex":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"Vertex","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graph\/vertex","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"associa